@startgantt 07_gantt
title Planificación estimada de AutoCuida (dedicación prevista: 4 h por día laborable)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
language es
printscale daily zoom 2
saturday are closed
sunday are closed
Project starts 2026-11-12

-- Fase 1 · Análisis --
[F1 Análisis de requisitos y matriz] as [A1] lasts 2 days
[F1 Arquitectura, BD y navegación] as [A2] lasts 1 day
[A2] starts at [A1]'s end

-- Fase 2 · Diseño --
[F2 Identidad visual y sistema de diseño] as [D1] lasts 2 days
[D1] starts at [A2]'s end
[F2 Mockups y diagramas iniciales] as [D2] lasts 2 days
[D2] starts at [D1]'s end

-- Fase 3 · Implementación --
[F3 Proyecto, Gradle y Room] as [I1] lasts 3 days
[I1] starts at [D2]'s end
[F3 Calculadora y repositorios] as [I2] lasts 3 days
[I2] starts at [I1]'s end
[F3 Pantallas y navegación] as [I3] lasts 6 days
[I3] starts at [I2]'s end
[F3 Notificaciones y gastos] as [I4] lasts 3 days
[I4] starts at [I3]'s end

-- Fase 4 · Pruebas --
[F4 Pruebas unitarias e integración] as [P1] lasts 3 days
[P1] starts at [I2]'s end
[F4 Pruebas funcionales y compatibilidad] as [P2] lasts 2 days
[P2] starts at [I4]'s end

-- Fase 5 · Documentación --
[F5 Informe técnico y diagramas] as [C1] lasts 6 days
[C1] starts at [P2]'s end
[F5 Manuales, README y bibliografía] as [C2] lasts 2 days
[C2] starts at [C1]'s end

-- Fase 6 · Presentación --
[F6 Presentación y guion de vídeo] as [V1] lasts 3 days
[V1] starts at [C2]'s end

-- Fase 7 · Cierre --
[F7 Revisión, APK y release] as [Z1] lasts 2 days
[Z1] starts at [V1]'s end
[Entrega] happens at [Z1]'s end
@endgantt
